00:35:09.840 --> 00:35:12.240
It's a very mysterious and I think it is,

00:35:12.240 --> 00:35:15.180
it's just the fact that we need
to understand how the brain

00:35:15.180 --> 00:35:17.940
works better in the first
place and not everything we're

00:35:17.940 --> 00:35:22.260
going to do is gonna have health
impacts in the short term.

00:35:22.260 --> 00:35:25.080
