00:36:27.840 --> 00:36:29.103
And that's not failure,

00:36:30.070 --> 00:36:32.010
it's actually how we make progress.

00:36:32.010 --> 00:36:34.200
These are the kinds of things
I think we scientists need to

00:36:34.200 --> 00:36:35.820
be a little bit more,

00:36:35.820 --> 00:36:38.670
a little bit better at
